{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23602","headline":"题东武丘寺六韵 · 白居易","name":"题东武丘寺六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香刹看非远，只园入始深。\n龙蟠松矫矫，玉立竹森森。\n怪石千僧坐，灵池一劒沈。\n海当亭两面，山在寺中心。\n酒熟凭花劝，诗成倩鸟吟。\n寄言轩冕客，此地好抽簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}